      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Up-to-dated concepts about the use of laparoscopy in the \"acute abdomen\" have been discussed. Most frequently performed procedures in abdominal emergencies and trauma were presented. Indications, contraindications, advantages and drawbacks with regard to own experience and literature were discussed."},
